# THE HOLLOW NETWORK — canonical season plan.
# L7N042 means Ledger program 7 / nominee namespace N / settlement pool 042.
# Celia Rook controls the foundation's reserved settlement authority; division
# heads can perform bounded operations but cannot create/retire the parent pool.
def hcase(n,title,tid,focus,fid,setting,sid,brief,bid,cast,truth,truthid):
 d=0 if n<21 else 1 if n<23 else 2
 scenes=[['Scene intake','Ledger examination','Access reconstruction','Witness review','Crime reconstruction'],['Case intake','Original records','Version comparison','Access review','Interviews','Cross-case desk','Resolution conference'],['Classified intake','Original archive','Source verification','Access reconstruction','Witness accounts','Relationship desk','Counter-hypotheses','Cross-case review','Final reconstruction']][d]
 scenesid=[['Penerimaan lokasi','Pemeriksaan buku besar','Rekonstruksi akses','Tinjauan saksi','Rekonstruksi kejahatan'],['Penerimaan kasus','Catatan asli','Pembandingan versi','Tinjauan akses','Wawancara','Meja lintas kasus','Konferensi penyelesaian'],['Penerimaan rahasia','Arsip asli','Verifikasi sumber','Rekonstruksi akses','Keterangan saksi','Meja hubungan','Hipotesis tandingan','Tinjauan lintas kasus','Rekonstruksi akhir']][d]
 chars=[]
 for line in cast.strip().split('\n'):
  p=line.split('|');p[3]=int(p[3]);chars.append(tuple(p))
 c=case(n,title,tid,focus,fid,setting,sid,brief,bid,'|'.join(scenes),'|'.join(scenesid),chars,truth,truthid);c['series']='hollow';c['episode']=n-18;c['volume']=4
 return c
# Non-spoiling interpretive alternatives for local checkpoints.
for n in range(19,25):D[n]=[
('A shared reference alone identifies the entire leadership.','Rujukan bersama saja mengidentifikasi seluruh kepemimpinan.'),('Access capability alone establishes the specific criminal act.','Kemampuan akses saja memastikan tindakan pidana spesifik.'),('A later summary is more reliable than every original source.','Ringkasan belakangan lebih andal daripada semua sumber asli.'),('Every connected person had the same knowledge and responsibility.','Semua orang terhubung memiliki pengetahuan serta tanggung jawab sama.'),('A motive replaces the need for independently corroborated conduct.','Motif menggantikan kebutuhan tindakan yang dikuatkan independen.'),('A plausible narrative proves all missing links.','Narasi masuk akal membuktikan semua hubungan yang hilang.'),('An ordinary client relationship establishes knowing participation.','Hubungan klien biasa memastikan keikutsertaan sadar.'),('A valid signature authenticates every interpretation attached to it.','Tanda tangan valid mengautentikasi semua tafsir yang dilekatkan padanya.')]
c=hcase(19,'The Broker','Perantara','Financial infrastructure','Infrastruktur keuangan','Bellamy Private Settlement Office','Kantor Penyelesaian Privat Bellamy',
'Marcus Bellamy is found murdered after threatening to expose an unpaid client. Two ledgers describe the same payments differently. Identify the killer before deciding what the larger pattern means.',
'Marcus Bellamy ditemukan terbunuh setelah mengancam mengungkap klien berutang. Dua buku besar menjelaskan pembayaran sama secara berbeda. Identifikasi pembunuh sebelum memutuskan arti pola lebih luas.',
'''Marcus Bellamy|Deceased financial intermediary|Perantara keuangan korban|52|Marcus kept a private ledger beyond the client-facing accounts.|Marcus menyimpan buku besar privat di luar rekening yang diperlihatkan kepada klien.|His final request sought the original client register, not ordinary cash.|Permintaan terakhirnya mencari daftar klien asli, bukan uang tunai biasa.
Theo Renn|Contract courier|Kurir kontrak|33|I delivered a sealed envelope and left the office untouched.|Saya mengantar amplop tersegel lalu meninggalkan kantor tanpa menyentuhnya.|My dispatch token and route recording can test my account.|Token pengiriman serta rekaman rute saya dapat menguji keterangan saya.
Iris Shaw|Bellamy's bookkeeper|Petugas pembukuan Bellamy|44|The public ledger used service labels where the private book used operational references.|Buku publik memakai label layanan saat buku privat memakai rujukan operasional.|L7N042 appears beside a retained original payment instruction.|L7N042 muncul di samping instruksi pembayaran asli yang disimpan.
Celia Rook|Foundation liaison|Penghubung yayasan|57|Our foundation purchased administrative services. I was not at Bellamy's final meeting.|Yayasan kami membeli layanan administratif. Saya tidak ada pada pertemuan terakhir Bellamy.|A client relationship should be checked against the actual authority behind each transaction.|Hubungan klien perlu diperiksa terhadap wewenang nyata di balik tiap transaksi.''',
'Theo Renn killed Bellamy during the courier appointment to seize his private client register and stop the exposure of Renn’s paid intimidation work. Continuous entrance footage, the dispatch-token record, Bellamy’s last recorded confrontation and the recovered blood-bearing desk weight in Renn’s sole-access courier bag establish the local crime. An unpaid client dispute supplied an alternative motive but the client’s independent alibi excludes the meeting window. Bellamy’s public ledger described service fees while his retained instructions grouped identity, laboratory and employment payments under L7N042. Those records establish a shared settlement trail, not the identity of whoever controlled the whole operation. The original register is recovered intact, giving the investigation its first durable network lead.',
'Theo Renn membunuh Bellamy saat janji kurir untuk merebut daftar klien privat serta menghentikan pengungkapan pekerjaan intimidasi berbayarnya. Rekaman masuk tanpa jeda, catatan token pengiriman, konfrontasi terakhir Bellamy yang terekam, serta pemberat meja berdarah di tas kurir akses tunggal Renn memastikan kejahatan setempat. Sengketa klien berutang memberi motif alternatif tetapi alibi independen klien menyingkirkan rentang pertemuan. Buku publik Bellamy menjelaskan biaya layanan sementara instruksi tersimpan mengelompokkan pembayaran identitas, laboratorium, serta ketenagakerjaan dengan L7N042. Catatan itu memastikan jejak penyelesaian bersama, bukan identitas pengendali seluruh operasi. Daftar asli ditemukan utuh dan memberi petunjuk jaringan permanen pertama.')
vrecords(c,'''Office photograph|Foto kantor|Bellamy's cash drawer is untouched. The client-register cabinet is open and a desk weight is missing.|Laci uang Bellamy tak tersentuh. Lemari daftar klien terbuka serta pemberat meja hilang.|The scene suggests a targeted record search rather than indiscriminate theft.|Lokasi mengisyaratkan pencarian catatan tertarget, bukan pencurian sembarang.
Public ledger|Buku besar publik|Three payments are labelled consulting, validation and placement. Their bank identifiers recur in Bellamy's private book.|Tiga pembayaran dilabeli konsultasi, validasi, penempatan. Pengenal banknya berulang pada buku privat Bellamy.|Two descriptions can refer to the same independently identifiable transfers.|Dua deskripsi dapat merujuk transfer sama yang diidentifikasi independen.
Private ledger|Buku besar privat|The same transfer identifiers carry identity, laboratory and recruitment labels, all grouped under L7N042.|Pengenal transfer sama memakai label identitas, laboratorium, rekrutmen, semua dikelompokkan dengan L7N042.|A common reference links administrative categories without proving their controller.|Rujukan bersama menghubungkan kategori administratif tanpa membuktikan pengendalinya.
Bank reconciliation|Rekonsiliasi bank|Certified bank entries match both books' amounts and transfer IDs. The disagreement is the service description, not whether payment occurred.|Entri bank tersertifikasi sesuai jumlah serta ID transfer kedua buku. Perbedaannya deskripsi layanan, bukan apakah pembayaran terjadi.|Independent banking records anchor the comparison.|Catatan bank independen menjadi dasar pembandingan.
Final appointments|Janji terakhir|Renn's courier visit follows Bellamy's last live call. No other visitor enters during the continuously recorded interval.|Kunjungan kurir Renn mengikuti panggilan hidup terakhir Bellamy. Tidak ada pengunjung lain masuk selama rentang terekam tanpa jeda.|The verified appointment establishes a specific opportunity window.|Janji terverifikasi memastikan rentang kesempatan spesifik.
Dispatch custody|Penguasaan pengiriman|Renn personally collects the individual dispatch token on camera and uses it at Bellamy's office.|Renn sendiri mengambil token pengiriman individu pada kamera serta memakainya di kantor Bellamy.|Credential use is corroborated by physical custody.|Pemakaian kredensial dikuatkan penguasaan fisik.
Confrontation recording|Rekaman konfrontasi|Bellamy's independently archived recorder captures Renn demanding the private register, followed by a struggle.|Perekam Bellamy diarsipkan independen menangkap Renn menuntut daftar privat, diikuti pergumulan.|The conflict concerns a specific register and the identified visitor.|Konflik menyangkut daftar tertentu serta pengunjung teridentifikasi.
Recovered weight|Pemberat ditemukan|A lawful search finds the missing weight with Bellamy's blood in Renn's exclusive courier bag. Its broken base fits the desk fragment.|Penggeledahan sah menemukan pemberat hilang dengan darah Bellamy dalam tas kurir eksklusif Renn. Dasar patahnya cocok dengan fragmen meja.|Recovered physical evidence corroborates the recorded confrontation.|Bukti fisik ditemukan menguatkan konfrontasi terekam.
Autopsy comparison|Pembandingan autopsi|Blunt-force injury is compatible with the recovered object. It does not on its own name the assailant.|Cedera tumpul sesuai benda ditemukan. Temuan sendiri tidak menyebut penyerang.|Mechanism and actor attribution require different supporting links.|Mekanisme serta atribusi pelaku memerlukan hubungan pendukung berbeda.
Unpaid-client review|Tinjauan klien berutang|The threatened client had a documented dispute but independent travel and venue footage exclude the final appointment.|Klien yang diancam memiliki sengketa terdokumentasi tetapi perjalanan serta rekaman tempat independen menyingkirkan janji terakhir.|An attractive motive must still fit verified opportunity.|Motif menarik tetap perlu sesuai kesempatan terverifikasi.
Intimidation fee|Biaya intimidasi|A signed instruction in Bellamy's register pays Renn for intimidating a debtor. Bellamy's exposure message names that payment.|Instruksi bertanda tangan dalam daftar Bellamy membayar Renn untuk mengintimidasi debitur. Pesan pengungkapan Bellamy menyebut pembayaran itu.|The recovered record supplies a corroborated local motive.|Catatan ditemukan memberi motif setempat yang dikuatkan.
Service destinations|Tujuan layanan|Original payment instructions name an authentication firm, a laboratory service account and an employment consultancy. None names a central organizer.|Instruksi pembayaran asli menyebut firma autentikasi, rekening layanan laboratorium, serta konsultan kerja. Tidak ada yang menyebut pengatur pusat.|The records expose divisions worth investigating while leaving command unresolved.|Catatan mengungkap divisi layak diselidiki sambil membiarkan komando belum terjawab.
Recovered client register|Daftar klien ditemukan|The original register retains L7N042 beside the three matched instructions and Renn's paid task. Chain of custody is complete.|Daftar asli mempertahankan L7N042 di samping tiga instruksi cocok serta tugas berbayar Renn. Rantai penguasaan lengkap.|The common reference survives as an authenticated cross-case lead.|Rujukan bersama tersisa sebagai petunjuk lintas kasus terautentikasi.
Reserved authority field|Kolom wewenang cadangan|The instructions contain a parent-authority field marked reserved. Bellamy could settle assigned transfers but could not create the parent pool.|Instruksi memuat kolom wewenang induk bertanda dicadangkan. Bellamy bisa menyelesaikan transfer ditugaskan tetapi tidak membuat kelompok induk.|Transaction handling and ultimate authorization are separate roles.|Penanganan transaksi serta otorisasi tertinggi adalah peran terpisah.''')
vf(c,'Who killed Bellamy?','Siapa membunuh Bellamy?','Theo Renn','Theo Renn',[('Iris Shaw from bookkeeping access alone','Iris Shaw dari akses pembukuan saja'),('The unpaid client despite the independent alibi','Klien berutang meski alibi independen'),('Every service recipient equally','Semua penerima layanan secara sama')],'Physical recovery, continuous access and the confrontation identify Renn.','Penemuan fisik, akses berkelanjutan, serta konfrontasi mengidentifikasi Renn.')
vf(c,'What was the immediate objective?','Apa tujuan langsungnya?','Seize the private register and suppress Renn’s paid intimidation record','Merebut daftar privat serta menekan catatan intimidasi berbayar Renn',[('Steal the untouched cash drawer','Mencuri laci uang tak tersentuh'),('Destroy an unrelated public brochure','Merusak brosur publik tak terkait'),('Personally create every service division','Secara pribadi membentuk semua divisi layanan')],'The demand and recovered fee instruction establish a local motive without assuming control of the network.','Tuntutan serta instruksi biaya ditemukan memastikan motif setempat tanpa menganggap kendali jaringan.')
vf(c,'What can L7N042 establish at this point?','Apa yang dapat dipastikan L7N042 saat ini?','A shared authenticated settlement reference requiring further investigation','Rujukan penyelesaian terautentikasi bersama yang perlu diselidiki lanjut',[('The identity of the architect already proved','Identitas perancang sudah terbukti'),('That all recipients knew every crime','Bahwa semua penerima mengetahui semua kejahatan'),('That every payment was an unrelated coincidence','Bahwa semua pembayaran kebetulan tak terkait')],'The first node is a financial connection, not a complete command structure.','Simpul pertama adalah hubungan keuangan, bukan struktur komando lengkap.')
tool(c,'hledger',1,'Parallel ledger desk','Meja buku besar paralel','Compare a transfer by bank ID across both books. Follow the reference, then separate the payment handler from the authorizing role.','Bandingkan transfer menurut ID bank pada kedua buku. Ikuti rujukan, lalu pisahkan pengelola pembayaran dari peran pemberi izin.',[
('Public labels','Label publik','Consulting · validation · placement. These are the client-facing descriptions.','Konsultasi · validasi · penempatan. Ini deskripsi yang ditampilkan kepada klien.'),('Private labels','Label privat','Identity · laboratory · recruitment. The amounts and transfer IDs match the public book.','Identitas · laboratorium · rekrutmen. Jumlah serta ID transfer sesuai buku publik.'),('Bank anchor','Dasar bank','Certified bank entries confirm each transfer. Description discrepancies survive independent reconciliation.','Entri bank tersertifikasi memastikan tiap transfer. Perbedaan deskripsi tetap ada setelah rekonsiliasi independen.'),('Reference L7N042','Rujukan L7N042','A shared settlement reference connects the entries. The register does not identify the holder of reserved parent authority.','Rujukan penyelesaian bersama menghubungkan entri. Daftar tidak mengidentifikasi pemegang wewenang induk cadangan.')],['E19-04','E19-05'])
c=hcase(20,'The Ghostmaker','Pembuat Identitas Bayangan','Identity infrastructure','Infrastruktur identitas','Saye Authentication Agency','Agensi Autentikasi Saye',
'Elena Cross carries the identity of a woman who died twelve years ago. She says she needed protection. Separate her circumstances from the operator who sold the identity, then follow Bellamy’s payment trail.',
'Elena Cross membawa identitas perempuan yang meninggal dua belas tahun lalu. Ia mengatakan membutuhkan perlindungan. Pisahkan keadaannya dari operator penjual identitas, lalu ikuti jejak pembayaran Bellamy.',
'''Elena Cross|Identity client|Klien identitas|31|I bought documents to leave someone who was threatening me. I did not know the other clients.|Saya membeli dokumen untuk meninggalkan orang yang mengancam saya. Saya tidak mengenal klien lain.|My saved messages distinguish what I requested from what the agency promised.|Pesan saya yang disimpan membedakan permintaan saya dari janji agensi.
Dorian Saye|Authentication agency owner|Pemilik agensi autentikasi|46|A former employee must have stolen the records.|Mantan pegawai pasti mencuri catatan.|My current authorization key controlled the disputed approvals.|Kunci otorisasi saya saat ini mengendalikan persetujuan disengketakan.
Tess Wren|Former agency employee|Mantan pegawai agensi|34|My access was revoked before these approvals. I kept the termination receipt.|Akses saya dicabut sebelum persetujuan ini. Saya menyimpan tanda terima penghentian.|An independent provider audit can check both the revocation and later signatures.|Audit penyedia independen bisa memeriksa pencabutan serta tanda tangan belakangan.
Dr. Mina Cole|Independent document examiner|Pemeriksa dokumen independen|42|Matching a biographical file is not the same as establishing the bearer’s identity.|Kecocokan berkas biografi tidak sama dengan memastikan identitas pembawa.|The original death register and current reference collection contradict the issued identity.|Daftar kematian asli serta pengambilan pembanding kini bertentangan dengan identitas diterbitkan.''',
'Dorian Saye operated the identity service through his legitimate agency. The original death register, incompatible bearer history, authenticated approval signatures after Tess’s revocation, preserved client messages and independently reconciled payments establish the operation. Elena’s messages corroborate an attempt to escape threats; they do not establish knowledge of the network’s other crimes. Dorian’s other client files explicitly promise concealment for paid assignments and share Bellamy’s L7N042 settlement references. Original bank identifiers link the same payments across the two investigations. That verifies common administrative infrastructure without proving every client had the same purpose or identifying the parent-authority holder. The former-employee accusation is contradicted by the provider’s revocation history and physical office records.',
'Dorian Saye menjalankan layanan identitas melalui agensi sahnya. Daftar kematian asli, riwayat pembawa tak sesuai, tanda tangan persetujuan terautentikasi setelah pencabutan akses Tess, pesan klien tersimpan, serta pembayaran direkonsiliasi independen memastikan operasi. Pesan Elena menguatkan upaya lepas dari ancaman; tidak memastikan pengetahuan kejahatan jaringan lain. Berkas klien lain Dorian secara eksplisit menjanjikan penyamaran bagi tugas berbayar serta berbagi rujukan penyelesaian L7N042 Bellamy. Pengenal bank asli menghubungkan pembayaran sama pada dua investigasi. Ini memverifikasi infrastruktur administratif bersama tanpa membuktikan semua klien bertujuan sama atau mengidentifikasi pemegang wewenang induk. Tuduhan mantan pegawai dibantah riwayat pencabutan akses penyedia serta catatan kantor fisik.')
vrecords(c,'''Bearer interview|Wawancara pembawa|Elena describes seeking protection and preserves the original agency conversation. The account does not describe other clients.|Elena menjelaskan mencari perlindungan serta menyimpan percakapan agensi asli. Keterangan tidak menjelaskan klien lain.|One client’s motive cannot establish the purpose of the entire service.|Motif satu klien tidak memastikan tujuan seluruh layanan.
Original death register|Daftar kematian asli|A certified historical register records the named identity holder’s death twelve years earlier.|Daftar historis tersertifikasi mencatat kematian pemilik identitas bernama dua belas tahun sebelumnya.|The issued biographical identity conflicts with a verified historical event.|Identitas biografis diterbitkan bertentangan dengan kejadian historis terverifikasi.
Reference comparison|Pembandingan referensi|Independent collection distinguishes Elena from the deceased holder’s verified records. The examiner preserves source provenance.|Pengambilan independen membedakan Elena dari catatan terverifikasi pemilik yang meninggal. Pemeriksa mempertahankan asal sumber.|The bearer cannot be identified merely by a matching document label.|Pembawa tidak dapat diidentifikasi hanya dari label dokumen cocok.
Agency approval record|Catatan persetujuan agensi|Dorian’s hardware-backed key signs the disputed approvals. The provider retains the original event journal.|Kunci berbasis perangkat Dorian menandatangani persetujuan sengketa. Penyedia menyimpan jurnal kejadian asli.|The approvals have attributable current authorization.|Persetujuan memiliki otorisasi kini yang dapat diatribusikan.
Former employee revocation|Pencabutan mantan pegawai|Tess’s access was revoked before every disputed approval; the independent provider confirms no later session.|Akses Tess dicabut sebelum semua persetujuan sengketa; penyedia independen memastikan tidak ada sesi belakangan.|The former-employee hypothesis fails the access chronology.|Hipotesis mantan pegawai gagal pada kronologi akses.
Office continuity|Kesinambungan kantor|Independent office footage places Dorian using the approval desk during the recorded sessions.|Rekaman kantor independen menempatkan Dorian memakai meja persetujuan selama sesi terekam.|Physical observations corroborate credential attribution.|Pengamatan fisik menguatkan atribusi kredensial.
Elena’s saved request|Permintaan Elena tersimpan|The original messages request escape from a threatening partner, not assistance with the other assigned crimes.|Pesan asli meminta lepas dari pasangan mengancam, bukan bantuan kejahatan penugasan lain.|Protective circumstances and knowing criminal facilitation must be distinguished.|Keadaan perlindungan serta fasilitasi pidana sadar perlu dibedakan.
Other client correspondence|Korespondensi klien lain|Separate authenticated files promise concealment for named paid assignments. Dorian acknowledges those purposes.|Berkas terautentikasi terpisah menjanjikan penyamaran bagi penugasan berbayar bernama. Dorian mengakui tujuan itu.|Specific communications support knowing facilitation for those clients.|Komunikasi spesifik mendukung fasilitasi sadar bagi klien tersebut.
Bank transaction IDs|ID transaksi bank|Certified entries match the bank identifiers recovered from Bellamy’s private instructions.|Entri tersertifikasi sesuai pengenal bank yang ditemukan pada instruksi privat Bellamy.|Independent identifiers link actual transfers across investigations.|Pengenal independen menghubungkan transfer nyata lintas investigasi.
Reference reconciliation|Rekonsiliasi rujukan|L7N042 appears on both agency receipts and Bellamy’s retained settlement copies with the same transfer IDs.|L7N042 muncul pada kuitansi agensi serta salinan penyelesaian Bellamy dengan ID transfer sama.|Shared references gain weight when independently anchored to the same events.|Rujukan bersama menjadi lebih kuat bila didasarkan independen pada kejadian sama.
Contract scope|Lingkup kontrak|The agency could approve assigned identity files but could not create or close the parent settlement pool.|Agensi bisa menyetujui berkas identitas ditugaskan tetapi tidak membuat atau menutup kelompok penyelesaian induk.|Operational control does not establish ultimate financial authority.|Kendali operasional tidak memastikan wewenang keuangan tertinggi.
Rental corroboration|Penguatan sewa|A lawfully obtained rental record places Dorian at the address used for client collection; Tess’s verified employment was elsewhere.|Catatan sewa diperoleh sah menempatkan Dorian di alamat pengambilan klien; pekerjaan Tess terverifikasi berada di tempat lain.|Independent location records support the service operator attribution.|Catatan lokasi independen mendukung atribusi operator layanan.
Preserved client index|Indeks klien tersimpan|The seized index lists aliases later found in laboratory and employment records. Those possible links require their own source checks.|Indeks disita memuat alias yang kemudian ditemukan pada catatan laboratorium serta kerja. Hubungan mungkin itu memerlukan pemeriksaan sumber sendiri.|An index opens new leads without proving every downstream allegation.|Indeks membuka petunjuk baru tanpa membuktikan semua tuduhan lanjutan.
Authenticated service summary|Ringkasan layanan terautentikasi|Approval logs, office continuity, client promises and matched transfers agree on Dorian’s operation. Elena’s limited knowledge remains separately documented.|Catatan persetujuan, kesinambungan kantor, janji klien, serta transfer cocok sesuai tentang operasi Dorian. Pengetahuan terbatas Elena tetap tercatat terpisah.|The operator and clients can have different levels of knowledge and responsibility.|Operator serta klien dapat memiliki tingkat pengetahuan serta tanggung jawab berbeda.''')
vf(c,'Who operated the identity service?','Siapa menjalankan layanan identitas?','Dorian Saye','Dorian Saye',[('Tess despite her verified revocation','Tess meski pencabutan terverifikasi'),('Elena solely because she used an alias','Elena hanya karena memakai alias'),('The deceased holder','Pemilik yang meninggal')],'Current approvals and physical continuity identify Dorian.','Persetujuan kini serta kesinambungan fisik mengidentifikasi Dorian.')
vf(c,'What is established about Elena’s knowledge?','Apa yang dipastikan tentang pengetahuan Elena?','Her protection request is corroborated; knowledge of other network crimes is not','Permintaan perlindungannya dikuatkan; pengetahuan kejahatan jaringan lain tidak',[('All clients knew the full operation','Semua klien tahu seluruh operasi'),('A false identity proves she committed every linked crime','Identitas palsu membuktikan ia melakukan semua kejahatan terkait'),('Her account cannot be tested','Keterangannya tidak bisa diuji')],'Specific messages establish scope more reliably than guilt by association.','Pesan spesifik memastikan lingkup lebih andal daripada kesalahan karena asosiasi.')
vf(c,'Which link to The Broker is strongest?','Hubungan mana dengan The Broker paling kuat?','Matching bank event IDs and authenticated receipts carrying L7N042','ID kejadian bank cocok serta kuitansi terautentikasi memuat L7N042',[('Only a similar company name','Hanya nama perusahaan serupa'),('A rumor about Bellamy','Rumor tentang Bellamy'),('Shared office décor','Dekorasi kantor sama')],'Two independently preserved source chains anchor a common administrative system.','Dua rantai sumber disimpan independen mendasari sistem administratif bersama.')
tool(c,'hidentity',1,'Identity verification desk','Meja verifikasi identitas','Compare bearer, history, approval and payment as separate questions.','Bandingkan pembawa, riwayat, persetujuan, serta pembayaran sebagai pertanyaan terpisah.',[('Bearer','Pembawa','Current reference collection does not support the issued historical identity.','Pengambilan pembanding kini tidak mendukung identitas historis diterbitkan.'),('History','Riwayat','The original death register predates the current bearer’s application.','Daftar kematian asli mendahului permohonan pembawa kini.'),('Approval','Persetujuan','The approval journal records Dorian’s current key after Tess’s revocation.','Jurnal persetujuan mencatat kunci kini Dorian setelah pencabutan Tess.'),('Source boundaries','Batas sumber','Who used an identity, who sold it and who knew its intended use are different questions.','Siapa memakai identitas, siapa menjual, serta siapa mengetahui tujuan pemakaiannya adalah pertanyaan berbeda.')],['E20-04','E20-05'])
c=hcase(21,'The Cleaner','Pembersih Jejak','Forensic infrastructure','Infrastruktur forensik','Metropolitan Laboratory Audit Unit','Unit Audit Laboratorium Metropolitan',
'Rebecca Sloan is killed after reporting altered homicide files. The supposed burglary targeted selected records. Find her killer and distinguish analytical uncertainty from an authenticated change to the evidence trail.',
'Rebecca Sloan dibunuh setelah melaporkan berkas pembunuhan diubah. Pencurian yang tampak menargetkan catatan tertentu. Temukan pembunuh serta bedakan ketidakpastian analitis dari perubahan terautentikasi pada jejak bukti.',
'''Rebecca Sloan|Deceased laboratory technician|Teknisi laboratorium korban|45|Rebecca preserved originals outside the final reporting system.|Rebecca menyimpan dokumen asli di luar sistem laporan akhir.|Her audit names repeated identity mappings, not merely uncertain measurements.|Auditnya menyebut pemetaan identitas berulang, bukan sekadar pengukuran tak pasti.
Felix Orne|Laboratory operations manager|Manajer operasi laboratorium|50|Any employee could have made an interpretive correction.|Pegawai mana pun bisa membuat koreksi tafsir.|My individual privilege could replace report mappings; routine analysts could only annotate them.|Hak individu saya bisa mengganti pemetaan laporan; analis biasa hanya memberi anotasi.
Vera Moss|Independent quality auditor|Auditor mutu independen|43|A changed interpretation differs from a changed sample identity.|Tafsir berubah berbeda dari identitas sampel berubah.|External revision records and retained extracts allow independent checks.|Catatan revisi luar serta ekstrak disimpan memungkinkan pemeriksaan independen.
Ed Renn|Routine analyst|Analis biasa|32|I annotated uncertainty but could not replace the identity field.|Saya memberi anotasi ketidakpastian tetapi tidak bisa mengganti kolom identitas.|My signed annotations remain intact beside later privileged changes.|Anotasi bertanda tangan saya tetap utuh di samping perubahan istimewa belakangan.
Ida Vale|Evidence custodian|Penjaga bukti|39|The targeted cupboard contained Rebecca’s original audit copies.|Lemari tertarget memuat salinan audit asli Rebecca.|A separate corridor camera records the access rather than relying on the report database.|Kamera koridor terpisah merekam akses, bukan mengandalkan basis data laporan.''',
'Felix Orne altered identity mappings in final forensic exports to protect selected aliases from the service exposed in The Ghostmaker. Retained extracts and an independent laboratory reject the substituted associations; the external revision journal attributes them to his privileged sessions. Rebecca recognized that pattern and preserved the source material. Felix killed her during the documented archive encounter and staged selective burglary to recover her copies. Continuous access footage, her preserved confrontation recording, the recovered blood-bearing damaged blade and its physical fracture fit independently support the murder allegation. Analytical uncertainty in Ed’s original annotations is genuine but does not explain the later identity replacements. Certified alias records and matched settlement payments link the forensic service to the identity and finance divisions. They establish institutional protection, not proof that any one division head controlled all the others.',
'Felix Orne mengubah pemetaan identitas pada ekspor forensik akhir untuk melindungi alias tertentu dari layanan yang diungkap The Ghostmaker. Ekstrak disimpan serta laboratorium independen menolak hubungan disubstitusi; jurnal revisi luar mengaitkannya dengan sesi berhak istimewanya. Rebecca mengenali pola serta menyimpan material sumber. Felix membunuhnya saat pertemuan arsip terdokumentasi lalu merekayasa pencurian selektif untuk merebut salinannya. Rekaman akses tanpa jeda, rekaman konfrontasi tersimpan, bilah rusak berdarah ditemukan, serta kecocokan patahan fisik mendukung tuduhan pembunuhan secara independen. Ketidakpastian analitis pada anotasi asli Ed nyata tetapi tidak menjelaskan penggantian identitas belakangan. Catatan alias tersertifikasi serta pembayaran penyelesaian cocok menghubungkan layanan forensik dengan divisi identitas serta keuangan. Ini memastikan perlindungan institusional, bukan bukti satu kepala divisi mengendalikan semua lainnya.')
vrecords(c,'''Selective burglary scene|Lokasi pencurian selektif|Valuable equipment is untouched; only Rebecca’s audit cupboard is disturbed.|Peralatan berharga tak tersentuh; hanya lemari audit Rebecca terganggu.|The selection suggests a record-focused objective.|Pemilihan mengisyaratkan tujuan tertuju catatan.
Original analytical notes|Catatan analitis asli|Ed’s signed notes describe uncertainty without changing source identity.|Catatan bertanda tangan Ed menjelaskan ketidakpastian tanpa mengubah identitas sumber.|Legitimate analytical uncertainty is not itself evidence substitution.|Ketidakpastian analitis sah bukan substitusi bukti dengan sendirinya.
Later identity exports|Ekspor identitas belakangan|Later reports replace the mapped identity while retaining the original measurement summary.|Laporan belakangan mengganti identitas dipetakan sambil mempertahankan ringkasan pengukuran asli.|A mapping change is distinct from a cautious interpretation.|Perubahan pemetaan berbeda dari tafsir hati-hati.
Retained extract audit|Audit ekstrak disimpan|Sealed original extracts and an outside laboratory do not support the exported identity associations.|Ekstrak asli tersegel serta laboratorium luar tidak mendukung hubungan identitas diekspor.|Independent material can test the disputed reporting association.|Material independen dapat menguji hubungan pelaporan sengketa.
Permission matrix|Matriks izin|Only manager sessions could replace mappings; routine analysts could annotate uncertainty.|Hanya sesi manajer bisa mengganti pemetaan; analis biasa bisa memberi anotasi ketidakpastian.|Capability must be narrowed before attributing a privileged action.|Kemampuan perlu dipersempit sebelum mengatribusikan tindakan istimewa.
External revision journal|Jurnal revisi luar|An independently retained journal attributes repeated mapping replacements to Felix’s individual credential.|Jurnal disimpan independen mengaitkan penggantian pemetaan berulang dengan kredensial individu Felix.|The disputed changes have independently preserved attribution.|Perubahan sengketa memiliki atribusi disimpan independen.
Corridor continuity|Kesinambungan koridor|Separate footage records Felix entering Rebecca’s archive meeting and leaving with her audit folder.|Rekaman terpisah merekam Felix masuk pertemuan arsip Rebecca lalu pergi membawa map auditnya.|Physical continuity corroborates the recorded access session.|Kesinambungan fisik menguatkan sesi akses tercatat.
Rebecca’s recording|Rekaman Rebecca|The original recording captures Rebecca confronting Felix about replacement identities and a subsequent assault.|Rekaman asli menangkap Rebecca menuntut Felix soal identitas pengganti serta penyerangan berikutnya.|A contemporaneous confrontation links the access to the local crime.|Konfrontasi sezaman menghubungkan akses dengan kejahatan setempat.
Recovered blade|Bilah ditemukan|A lawful search finds a damaged blade with Rebecca’s blood in Felix’s exclusive storage.|Penggeledahan sah menemukan bilah rusak dengan darah Rebecca di penyimpanan eksklusif Felix.|Controlled physical recovery independently links the suspect and victim.|Penemuan fisik terkendali menghubungkan tersangka serta korban independen.
Fracture comparison|Pembandingan patahan|A scene fragment physically fits the recovered blade; generic wound shape alone would not identify it.|Fragmen lokasi cocok secara fisik dengan bilah ditemukan; bentuk luka umum saja tidak mengidentifikasinya.|A physical fit is stronger than broad tool-class compatibility.|Kecocokan fisik lebih kuat daripada kesesuaian kelas alat luas.
Preserved confidential report|Laporan rahasia tersimpan|Rebecca’s externally delivered report predates her death and names the repeated alias pattern.|Laporan Rebecca dikirim ke luar mendahului kematian serta menyebut pola alias berulang.|The report establishes what she had discovered before the attack.|Laporan memastikan yang telah ia temukan sebelum serangan.
Alias cross-reference|Rujukan silang alias|Certified agency originals from Episode 02 match the protected report aliases by stable record identifiers.|Dokumen asli agensi tersertifikasi dari Episode 02 sesuai alias laporan dilindungi menurut pengenal catatan stabil.|Independent identity records corroborate the cross-case connection.|Catatan identitas independen menguatkan hubungan lintas kasus.
Settlement comparison|Pembandingan penyelesaian|Laboratory service receipts reconcile with Bellamy’s original L7N042 transfers.|Kuitansi layanan laboratorium direkonsiliasi dengan transfer asli L7N042 Bellamy.|Finance and forensic services share independently anchored transactions.|Keuangan serta layanan forensik berbagi transaksi berdasar independen.
Assignment limits|Batas penugasan|Felix could alter assigned laboratory records but could not issue identities or authorize the parent pool.|Felix bisa mengubah catatan laboratorium ditugaskan tetapi tidak menerbitkan identitas atau mengizinkan kelompok induk.|Operational reach does not equal central command.|Jangkauan operasional tidak sama dengan komando pusat.
Originals recovery|Penemuan dokumen asli|The missing folder is recovered with intact external delivery copies, preserving the audit despite the attack.|Map hilang ditemukan bersama salinan pengiriman luar utuh, mempertahankan audit meski terjadi serangan.|Redundant independent custody prevents one stolen copy from erasing the trail.|Penguasaan independen berlapis mencegah satu salinan dicuri menghapus jejak.
Integrated crime review|Tinjauan kejahatan gabungan|Access, confrontation and physical recovery support Felix’s killing; revision and source comparisons separately establish tampering.|Akses, konfrontasi, serta penemuan fisik mendukung pembunuhan oleh Felix; revisi serta pembandingan sumber secara terpisah memastikan manipulasi.|Murder and report alteration require separate converging proof.|Pembunuhan serta perubahan laporan memerlukan bukti berbeda yang saling menguatkan.''')
for en,ind,ok,oid,wrong in [
('Who killed Rebecca?','Siapa membunuh Rebecca?','Felix Orne','Felix Orne',[('Ed from uncertainty annotations alone','Ed dari anotasi ketidakpastian saja'),('Ida solely from custody duties','Ida hanya dari tugas penguasaan'),('Every employee with office access','Semua pegawai berakses kantor')]),
('What was manipulated?','Apa yang dimanipulasi?','Final identity mappings, not the preserved original observations','Pemetaan identitas akhir, bukan pengamatan asli disimpan',[('Every original extract was absent','Semua ekstrak asli tidak ada'),('Only cautious wording with no identity changes','Hanya kata-kata hati-hati tanpa perubahan identitas'),('The victim’s name in a public brochure','Nama korban dalam brosur publik')]),
('What links the first three divisions?','Apa menghubungkan tiga divisi pertama?','Matched transfers and independently verified alias-to-report records','Transfer cocok serta catatan alias-ke-laporan diverifikasi independen',[('Shared décor','Dekorasi sama'),('One rumor','Satu rumor'),('Identical emotional reactions','Reaksi emosi identik')]),
('Why target the audit folder?','Mengapa map audit ditargetkan?','It preserved the originals that exposed the protected identities','Map menyimpan dokumen asli pengungkap identitas dilindungi',[('It contained ordinary cash','Map memuat uang tunai biasa'),('It could create the parent pool','Map bisa membuat kelompok induk'),('Its theft would erase all outside copies','Pencuriannya menghapus semua salinan luar')])]:vf(c,en,ind,ok,oid,wrong,ok,oid)
tool(c,'hforensic',2,'Original and revision comparator','Pembanding dokumen asli serta revisi','Keep sample provenance, interpretation and identity mapping separate.','Pisahkan asal sampel, tafsir, serta pemetaan identitas.',[('Original','Asli','Retained measurements preserve the initial observations.','Pengukuran disimpan mempertahankan pengamatan awal.'),('Interpretation','Tafsir','Signed uncertainty annotations remain genuine.','Anotasi ketidakpastian bertanda tangan tetap asli.'),('Replacement','Penggantian','A privileged later action changed the mapped identity.','Tindakan istimewa belakangan mengubah identitas dipetakan.'),('Independent check','Pemeriksaan independen','Outside material and an external journal test the change.','Material luar serta jurnal eksternal menguji perubahan.')],['E21-04','E21-05','E21-06'])
c=hcase(22,'The Recruiter','Perekrut','Human infrastructure','Infrastruktur manusia','Meridian Placement Consultancy','Konsultan Penempatan Meridian',
'Three suspects describe unusual employment offers before unrelated offenses. The offers share language but not a visible sender. Identify the coordinator and distinguish deliberate participation from work accepted under misleading information.',
'Tiga tersangka menjelaskan tawaran kerja tak biasa sebelum pelanggaran berbeda. Tawaran berbagi bahasa tetapi tidak menampilkan pengirim sama. Identifikasi koordinator serta bedakan keikutsertaan sengaja dari pekerjaan diterima dengan informasi menyesatkan.',
'''Mara Vale|Consultancy assignment coordinator|Koordinator penugasan konsultan|41|Our intermediaries placed ordinary jobs independently.|Perantara kami menempatkan pekerjaan biasa secara independen.|My scheduling account controlled the final assignment versions.|Akun penjadwalan saya mengendalikan versi penugasan akhir.
Rafe Miller|Contract worker|Pekerja kontrak|35|I knew the assigned entry was unauthorized. I did not know the laboratory operation.|Saya tahu masuk yang ditugaskan tanpa izin. Saya tidak tahu operasi laboratorium.|My original messages name the unlawful entry but not the other divisions.|Pesan asli saya menyebut masuk tak sah tetapi bukan divisi lain.
Nina Shaw|Logistics contractor|Kontraktor logistik|38|I was told I was delivering sealed training records.|Saya diberi tahu mengantar catatan pelatihan tersegel.|The version I received omitted the unauthorized destination revealed later.|Versi yang saya terima menghilangkan tujuan tanpa izin yang terungkap belakangan.
Dr. Oren Bell|Research contractor|Kontraktor riset|47|I knew the reference transfer breached the stated approval. I was not told who controlled settlement.|Saya tahu transfer pembanding melanggar persetujuan dinyatakan. Saya tidak diberi tahu pengendali penyelesaian.|My retained copy preserves the instruction I knowingly accepted.|Salinan saya mempertahankan instruksi yang dengan sadar saya terima.
Leila Moss|Independent communications auditor|Auditor komunikasi independen|44|Personal crises explain context; they do not predict who commits a crime.|Krisis pribadi menjelaskan konteks; tidak meramalkan siapa melakukan kejahatan.|Original message versions and signatures establish the actual distribution of knowledge.|Versi pesan asli serta tanda tangan memastikan pembagian pengetahuan sebenarnya.''',
'Mara Vale coordinated recruitment through separately branded intermediaries, matching specific access and skills to narrowly described tasks. Signed scheduling changes, original message versions, authenticated fee instructions and the independent delivery journal establish her control. Financial hardship and threatened reputations supplied leverage but do not by themselves prove intent. Rafe knowingly accepted unlawful entry; Oren knowingly accepted an unauthorized reference transfer; Nina’s retained instruction concealed the unlawful destination and does not establish knowing participation in the broader crimes. Their different knowledge was a feature of the assignment design. Fees reconcile with L7N042, identities match Episode 02 and task requests reference the laboratory service from Episode 03. Mara could allocate approved tasks and fees but could not alter the reserved parent authority. The hierarchy therefore contains an active recruiter beneath an unresolved coordinating layer.',
'Mara Vale mengoordinasikan rekrutmen melalui perantara bermerek terpisah, mencocokkan akses serta keterampilan dengan tugas berdeskripsi sempit. Perubahan jadwal bertanda tangan, versi pesan asli, instruksi biaya terautentikasi, serta jurnal pengiriman independen memastikan kendalinya. Kesulitan keuangan serta reputasi terancam memberi tekanan tetapi tidak dengan sendirinya membuktikan niat. Rafe secara sadar menerima masuk tak sah; Oren secara sadar menerima transfer pembanding tanpa izin; instruksi tersimpan Nina menyembunyikan tujuan tak sah serta tidak memastikan keikutsertaan sadar dalam kejahatan luas. Perbedaan pengetahuan adalah bagian desain penugasan. Biaya direkonsiliasi dengan L7N042, identitas sesuai Episode 02, serta permintaan tugas merujuk layanan laboratorium Episode 03. Mara bisa mengalokasikan tugas serta biaya disetujui tetapi tidak mengubah wewenang induk cadangan. Hierarki memuat perekrut aktif di bawah lapisan koordinasi yang belum terjawab.')
vrecords(c,'''Three offer versions|Tiga versi tawaran|The offers have different branding but the same unusual assignment phrase and revision pattern.|Tawaran memiliki merek berbeda tetapi frasa penugasan tak biasa serta pola revisi sama.|Shared wording is a lead that needs authorship corroboration.|Kata-kata sama adalah petunjuk yang memerlukan penguatan kepenulisan.
Original scheduling journal|Jurnal penjadwalan asli|An independent provider records Mara’s credential issuing the final versions through all three intermediaries.|Penyedia independen mencatat kredensial Mara menerbitkan versi akhir melalui tiga perantara.|Original signatures connect the apparently separate senders.|Tanda tangan asli menghubungkan pengirim yang tampak terpisah.
Capability table|Tabel kemampuan|The assignments map existing building access, reference-data access and courier routes to different workers.|Penugasan memetakan akses gedung, akses data pembanding, serta rute kurir yang sudah ada kepada pekerja berbeda.|Specific capabilities explain selection better than a generic personality label.|Kemampuan spesifik menjelaskan pemilihan lebih baik daripada label kepribadian umum.
Circumstance records|Catatan keadaan|The workers faced different documented pressures. Many people with similar pressures received no criminal assignment.|Pekerja menghadapi tekanan terdokumentasi berbeda. Banyak orang bertekanan serupa tidak menerima tugas pidana.|Vulnerability is context, not a deterministic predictor of conduct.|Kerentanan adalah konteks, bukan prediktor tindakan deterministik.
Rafe’s retained messages|Pesan Rafe tersimpan|The instruction explicitly calls the entry unauthorized, and Rafe acknowledges that wording.|Instruksi secara eksplisit menyebut masuk tanpa izin, serta Rafe mengakui kata-katanya.|The individual’s own authenticated record supports knowledge of that act.|Catatan terautentikasi individu sendiri mendukung pengetahuan tindakan itu.
Nina’s retained messages|Pesan Nina tersimpan|Nina receives a sealed-training delivery instruction; the unlawful destination appears only in a version withheld from her.|Nina menerima instruksi pengiriman pelatihan tersegel; tujuan tak sah hanya muncul pada versi yang ditahan darinya.|The disclosed task does not establish knowledge of the concealed objective.|Tugas diungkap tidak memastikan pengetahuan tujuan tersembunyi.
Oren’s retained messages|Pesan Oren tersimpan|Oren is explicitly warned the reference transfer is outside approval, then accepts the paid task.|Oren secara eksplisit diperingatkan transfer pembanding di luar persetujuan, lalu menerima tugas berbayar.|The preserved warning distinguishes knowing acceptance from mere administrative contact.|Peringatan tersimpan membedakan penerimaan sadar dari kontak administratif semata.
Version delivery receipts|Tanda terima pengiriman versi|Independent receipts establish which worker received which version before acting.|Tanda terima independen memastikan pekerja mana menerima versi mana sebelum bertindak.|Actual exposure matters more than an investigator’s assumption of shared knowledge.|Paparan sebenarnya lebih penting daripada asumsi penyidik tentang pengetahuan bersama.
Consultancy fee ledger|Buku biaya konsultan|Mara’s signed allocations match Bellamy’s L7N042 payment events.|Alokasi bertanda tangan Mara sesuai kejadian pembayaran L7N042 Bellamy.|The recruitment fees join the established financial trail.|Biaya rekrutmen bergabung dengan jejak keuangan yang sudah dipastikan.
Identity cross-check|Pemeriksaan silang identitas|Stable agency identifiers link selected assignment identities to Episode 02’s certified records.|Pengenal agensi stabil menghubungkan identitas penugasan tertentu dengan catatan tersertifikasi Episode 02.|The identity connection rests on records rather than name resemblance.|Hubungan identitas bertumpu pada catatan, bukan kemiripan nama.
Laboratory task request|Permintaan tugas laboratorium|An authenticated request names the protected alias set identified in Rebecca’s audit.|Permintaan terautentikasi menyebut kelompok alias dilindungi yang diidentifikasi audit Rebecca.|A specific task connects recruitment to the forensic service.|Tugas spesifik menghubungkan rekrutmen dengan layanan forensik.
Intermediary contracts|Kontrak perantara|The intermediaries can relay approved offers but cannot change task scope without Mara’s authorization.|Perantara bisa meneruskan tawaran disetujui tetapi tidak mengubah lingkup tanpa izin Mara.|Relay functions and assignment control are distinct hierarchy roles.|Fungsi penerusan serta kendali penugasan adalah peran hierarki berbeda.
Rejected withdrawal message|Pesan pengunduran diri ditolak|A worker’s withdrawal is followed by a message quoting private facts unavailable to the placement form.|Pengunduran diri pekerja diikuti pesan mengutip fakta privat yang tidak ada pada formulir penempatan.|The pressure message opens a separate question about information access.|Pesan tekanan membuka pertanyaan terpisah tentang akses informasi.
Parent-authority limit|Batas wewenang induk|The provider confirms Mara cannot create the settlement pool or revise its reserved owner field.|Penyedia memastikan Mara tidak bisa membuat kelompok penyelesaian atau merevisi kolom pemilik dicadangkan.|A coordinator of tasks is not automatically the architect of the whole system.|Koordinator tugas tidak otomatis perancang seluruh sistem.
Independent command review|Tinjauan komando independen|Signed instructions and delivery history identify Mara’s recruiting control while preserving each worker’s different knowledge.|Instruksi bertanda tangan serta riwayat pengiriman mengidentifikasi kendali rekrutmen Mara sambil mempertahankan perbedaan pengetahuan pekerja.|Responsibility can be allocated without treating every participant as equally informed.|Tanggung jawab dapat dibagi tanpa menganggap semua peserta sama tahunya.
Information-source lead|Petunjuk sumber informasi|The private-fact message refers to a Northline Risk service account not controlled by the placement intermediaries.|Pesan fakta privat merujuk rekening layanan Northline Risk yang tidak dikuasai perantara penempatan.|A distinct information service warrants the next investigation.|Layanan informasi berbeda memerlukan investigasi berikutnya.''')
for en,ind,ok,oid,wrong in [
('Who coordinated the offers?','Siapa mengoordinasikan tawaran?','Mara Vale through authenticated scheduling control','Mara Vale melalui kendali penjadwalan terautentikasi',[('Each intermediary independently with no common control','Tiap perantara independen tanpa kendali bersama'),('Nina because she delivered a sealed file','Nina karena mengantar berkas tersegel'),('Everyone under financial pressure','Semua orang bertekanan keuangan')]),
('What best explains selection?','Apa paling menjelaskan pemilihan?','Task-relevant access and capabilities, with documented pressures used as leverage','Akses serta kemampuan relevan tugas, dengan tekanan terdokumentasi sebagai pengaruh',[('A diagnosis inferred from hardship','Diagnosis disimpulkan dari kesulitan'),('A shared criminal personality','Kepribadian kriminal bersama'),('Random ordinary hiring','Perekrutan biasa acak')]),
('Which knowledge assessment is supported?','Penilaian pengetahuan mana didukung?','Rafe and Oren knew the specified unlawful acts; Nina’s supplied version concealed the unlawful destination','Rafe serta Oren tahu tindakan tak sah tertentu; versi Nina menyembunyikan tujuan tak sah',[('All knew the whole network','Semua tahu seluruh jaringan'),('None knew any wrongdoing','Tidak ada yang tahu pelanggaran apa pun'),('Nina knew more because her task looked ordinary','Nina tahu lebih banyak karena tugasnya tampak biasa')]),
('What remains unresolved?','Apa yang belum terjawab?','Who holds reserved authority above task allocation and private-data pressure','Siapa memegang wewenang cadangan di atas alokasi tugas serta tekanan data privat',[('Whether original offer versions exist','Apakah versi tawaran asli ada'),('Whether Mara controlled scheduling','Apakah Mara mengendalikan jadwal'),('Whether fees share settlement references','Apakah biaya berbagi rujukan penyelesaian')])]:vf(c,en,ind,ok,oid,wrong,ok,oid)
tool(c,'hrecruit',2,'Assignment and knowledge board','Papan penugasan serta pengetahuan','Compare capabilities, received instructions and known consequences before assigning a role.','Bandingkan kemampuan, instruksi diterima, serta akibat diketahui sebelum menetapkan peran.',[('Rafe','Rafe','Unauthorized entry is explicit in his received version.','Masuk tanpa izin eksplisit pada versi diterimanya.'),('Nina','Nina','Her received version describes sealed training delivery and omits the illicit destination.','Versi diterimanya menjelaskan pengiriman pelatihan tersegel serta menghilangkan tujuan tak sah.'),('Oren','Oren','The approval breach is explicit before his recorded acceptance.','Pelanggaran persetujuan eksplisit sebelum penerimaannya terekam.'),('Command boundary','Batas komando','Mara controls assigned offers; parent-pool ownership remains outside her role.','Mara mengendalikan tawaran ditugaskan; kepemilikan kelompok induk tetap di luar perannya.')],['E22-04','E22-05','E22-06'])
c=hcase(23,'The Watcher','Pengawas','Intelligence infrastructure','Infrastruktur intelijen','Northline Risk Consultancy','Konsultan Risiko Northline',
'Cybersecurity investigator Adrian Knox vanishes while tracing coordinated surveillance. His sources span the four exposed divisions. Reconstruct who collected the information, who used it, and where he was taken.',
'Penyidik keamanan siber Adrian Knox hilang saat menelusuri pengawasan terkoordinasi. Sumbernya mencakup empat divisi terungkap. Rekonstruksi siapa mengumpulkan informasi, siapa memakai, serta ke mana ia dibawa.',
'''Adrian Knox|Missing cybersecurity investigator|Penyidik keamanan siber hilang|38|Adrian preserved access histories outside the contractor’s system.|Adrian menyimpan riwayat akses di luar sistem kontraktor.|His last report separated authorized collection from undisclosed tasking.|Laporan terakhirnya memisahkan pengumpulan berizin dari penugasan tersembunyi.
Ivo Hale|Northline operations controller|Pengendali operasi Northline|47|Our access was covered by ordinary security contracts.|Akses kami dicakup kontrak keamanan biasa.|The retained contract and the private query ledger can be compared.|Kontrak tersimpan serta buku kueri privat dapat dibandingkan.
Rina Sol|Independent access auditor|Auditor akses independen|42|Read access is not unlimited permission to monitor personal life.|Akses baca bukan izin tak terbatas mengawasi kehidupan pribadi.|Provider journals preserve which account requested each disclosure.|Jurnal penyedia mempertahankan rekening peminta tiap pengungkapan.
Nina Shaw|Former assignment courier|Mantan kurir penugasan|38|The withdrawal message quoted private details I never supplied to the recruiter.|Pesan pengunduran diri mengutip detail privat yang tidak saya berikan kepada perekrut.|My original message and the provider timestamps allow a source comparison.|Pesan asli saya serta waktu penyedia memungkinkan pembandingan sumber.
Omar Pike|Contract transport supervisor|Pengawas transportasi kontrak|40|Knox was moved under an instruction labelled protective consultation.|Knox dipindahkan dengan instruksi berlabel konsultasi perlindungan.|Independent gate footage shows the instruction did not allow him to leave.|Rekaman gerbang independen menunjukkan instruksi tidak membolehkannya pergi.
Celia Rook|Foundation liaison|Penghubung yayasan|57|Several services billed our foundation. A bill alone is not an instruction.|Beberapa layanan menagih yayasan kami. Tagihan saja bukan instruksi.|Authority must be established through original ownership and access records.|Wewenang perlu dipastikan melalui catatan kepemilikan serta akses asli.''',
'Ivo Hale controlled the undisclosed surveillance tasking behind Northline’s legitimate security work. Independent provider journals link his authenticated requests to private records across the four divisions; matched disclosure events precede coercive withdrawal messages. Original contracts do not authorize those uses. The targeted information differs by person, showing tailored pressure rather than a universal psychological formula. Knox identified the information trail and was detained under Ivo’s signed transport instruction. Gate footage, the vehicle record and current warrant-backed observations locate him alive at unit K-3. Finance, identity, laboratory and recruitment disclosures all carry reserved parent-account references reconcilable to L7N042. A historical delegation register shows the five divisions report to the same reserved authority, but the current working copy withholds its holder. That connection triggers a comparison with the original charter in the finale; Ivo’s operational reach alone does not identify the architect.',
'Ivo Hale mengendalikan penugasan pengawasan tersembunyi di balik kerja keamanan sah Northline. Jurnal penyedia independen menghubungkan permintaan terautentikasinya dengan catatan privat lintas empat divisi; kejadian pengungkapan cocok mendahului pesan paksaan pengunduran diri. Kontrak asli tidak mengizinkan pemakaian itu. Informasi tertarget berbeda menurut orang, menunjukkan tekanan disesuaikan, bukan rumus psikologis universal. Knox mengidentifikasi jejak informasi lalu ditahan berdasarkan instruksi transportasi bertanda tangan Ivo. Rekaman gerbang, catatan kendaraan, serta pengamatan terkini berizin menempatkannya hidup di unit K-3. Pengungkapan keuangan, identitas, laboratorium, serta rekrutmen membawa rujukan rekening induk cadangan yang dapat direkonsiliasi dengan L7N042. Daftar delegasi historis menunjukkan lima divisi melapor pada wewenang cadangan sama, tetapi salinan kerja kini menutup pemegangnya. Hubungan itu memicu pembandingan dengan piagam asli pada final; jangkauan operasional Ivo saja tidak mengidentifikasi perancang.')
vrecords(c,'''Knox’s missing report|Laporan hilang Knox|Knox vanishes after delivering an externally timestamped access-audit draft.|Knox hilang setelah mengirim draf audit akses bertanda waktu luar.|The draft establishes what he had investigated before disappearing.|Draf memastikan yang diselidikinya sebelum hilang.
Original security contract|Kontrak keamanan asli|Northline’s contract permits bounded security monitoring, not private-life leverage against workers.|Kontrak Northline mengizinkan pemantauan keamanan terbatas, bukan tekanan kehidupan privat pada pekerja.|Institutional access must be compared with its authorized purpose.|Akses institusional perlu dibandingkan dengan tujuan berizinnya.
Private query ledger|Buku kueri privat|A retained ledger targets people linked to finance, identity, laboratory and recruitment files.|Buku disimpan menargetkan orang terkait berkas keuangan, identitas, laboratorium, serta rekrutmen.|The target set connects multiple divisions but does not alone name the controller.|Kelompok target menghubungkan beberapa divisi tetapi sendiri tidak menyebut pengendali.
Provider query signatures|Tanda tangan kueri penyedia|Independent journals attribute the private queries to Ivo’s individual tasking key.|Jurnal independen mengaitkan kueri privat dengan kunci penugasan individu Ivo.|Externally preserved signatures support operational attribution.|Tanda tangan disimpan luar mendukung atribusi operasional.
Disclosure event chronology|Kronologi pengungkapan|The queried private details are disclosed shortly before withdrawal-pressure messages, with independent timestamps.|Detail privat diku eri diungkap sesaat sebelum pesan tekanan pengunduran diri, dengan waktu independen.|A time-linked disclosure can test the source of a coercive message.|Pengungkapan terkait waktu dapat menguji sumber pesan paksaan.
Nina’s source comparison|Pembandingan sumber Nina|The quoted detail is absent from her recruitment form but present in Ivo’s prior provider result.|Detail dikutip tidak ada pada formulir rekrutmen Nina tetapi ada pada hasil penyedia Ivo sebelumnya.|A specific source comparison supports the information path.|Pembandingan sumber spesifik mendukung jalur informasi.
Other target contexts|Konteks target lain|Different workers receive pressure based on different documented concerns; similar personal circumstances do not establish equal participation.|Pekerja berbeda menerima tekanan atas kekhawatiran terdokumentasi berbeda; keadaan pribadi serupa tidak memastikan keikutsertaan setara.|Individualized pressure must not be treated as a deterministic profile.|Tekanan individual tidak boleh dianggap profil deterministik.
Tasking authority limits|Batas wewenang penugasan|Ivo can request assigned disclosures but cannot create or close the reserved parent account.|Ivo bisa meminta pengungkapan ditugaskan tetapi tidak membuat atau menutup rekening induk cadangan.|Broad observation access is not ultimate organizational authority.|Akses pengamatan luas bukan wewenang organisasi tertinggi.
Knox’s preserved source pack|Paket sumber Knox tersimpan|Outside copies preserve the contract, signatures and target comparisons despite the local disappearance.|Salinan luar mempertahankan kontrak, tanda tangan, serta pembandingan target meski Knox hilang.|Independent copies sustain the audit beyond one compromised location.|Salinan independen mempertahankan audit melampaui satu lokasi tercemar.
Transport instruction|Instruksi transportasi|Ivo’s authenticated instruction directs a vehicle to collect Knox for a protective consultation at K-3.|Instruksi terautentikasi Ivo mengarahkan kendaraan menjemput Knox untuk konsultasi perlindungan di K-3.|A specific instruction supplies a testable route for the disappearance.|Instruksi spesifik memberi rute dapat diuji bagi hilangnya Knox.
Gate sequence|Urutan gerbang|Independent footage shows Knox arriving and being prevented from leaving the secured unit.|Rekaman independen menunjukkan Knox tiba serta dicegah meninggalkan unit terkunci.|The observed restriction contradicts a freely voluntary visit.|Pembatasan diamati bertentangan dengan kunjungan sukarela bebas.
Vehicle corroboration|Penguatan kendaraan|Certified transport records and separate entrance imagery match the ordered vehicle and route.|Catatan transportasi tersertifikasi serta gambar masuk terpisah sesuai kendaraan serta rute diperintah.|Independent movement sources corroborate the transport account.|Sumber gerak independen menguatkan keterangan transportasi.
Current welfare observation|Pengamatan keselamatan terkini|Warrant-backed officers confirm Knox visible alive inside K-3 and coordinate his recovery.|Petugas berizin memastikan Knox terlihat hidup di K-3 serta mengoordinasikan penyelamatan.|A current checked observation supports a recovery decision.|Pengamatan terkini diperiksa mendukung keputusan penyelamatan.
Finance disclosure link|Hubungan pengungkapan keuangan|The private queries include Bellamy transfer IDs already certified in Episode 01.|Kueri privat memuat ID transfer Bellamy yang sudah tersertifikasi pada Episode 01.|Stable original identifiers connect surveillance with the financial case.|Pengenal asli stabil menghubungkan pengawasan dengan kasus keuangan.
Identity disclosure link|Hubungan pengungkapan identitas|Provider results reference the same agency record IDs verified in Episode 02.|Hasil penyedia merujuk ID catatan agensi sama yang diverifikasi pada Episode 02.|The identity connection is independently traceable.|Hubungan identitas dapat ditelusuri independen.
Forensic and recruitment links|Hubungan forensik serta rekrutmen|The target pack contains the protected alias set and assignment IDs established in Episodes 03 and 04.|Paket target memuat kelompok alias dilindungi serta ID penugasan yang dipastikan pada Episode 03 serta 04.|Specific records join the two remaining operational divisions.|Catatan spesifik menggabungkan dua divisi operasional tersisa.
Parent reference reconciliation|Rekonsiliasi rujukan induk|Provider billing ties the target pack to reserved authority and settlement reference L7N042.|Tagihan penyedia mengaitkan paket target dengan wewenang cadangan serta rujukan penyelesaian L7N042.|Independent billing connects information control to the shared administrative system.|Tagihan independen menghubungkan kendali informasi dengan sistem administratif bersama.
Historical delegation copy|Salinan delegasi historis|A working register lists five bounded divisions reporting to one reserved authority, with its holder withheld.|Daftar kerja memuat lima divisi terbatas melapor pada satu wewenang cadangan, dengan pemegang ditutup.|A common coordination layer is supported while its personal identity remains unresolved.|Lapisan koordinasi bersama didukung sementara identitas pribadinya belum terjawab.
Original charter locator|Penunjuk piagam asli|The register supplies the independent archive reference for the original ownership charter.|Daftar memberi rujukan arsip independen bagi piagam kepemilikan asli.|The next investigation has a concrete source capable of testing central authority.|Investigasi berikutnya memiliki sumber konkret yang bisa menguji wewenang pusat.
Integrated intelligence review|Tinjauan intelijen gabungan|Signatures establish Ivo’s tasking; transport evidence establishes Knox’s detention; billing and delegation expose a shared parent layer.|Tanda tangan memastikan penugasan Ivo; bukti transportasi memastikan penahanan Knox; tagihan serta delegasi mengungkap lapisan induk bersama.|Local responsibility and the unresolved network hierarchy can be separated.|Tanggung jawab setempat serta hierarki jaringan belum terjawab dapat dipisahkan.''')
