('Who controlled the undisclosed surveillance tasking?','Siapa mengendalikan penugasan pengawasan tersembunyi?','Ivo Hale','Ivo Hale',[('Every database custodian equally','Semua penjaga basis data secara sama'),('Nina from being targeted','Nina karena ditargetkan'),('Knox from discovering it','Knox karena menemukannya')]),
('What happened to Knox?','Apa yang terjadi pada Knox?','He was detained at K-3 under Ivo’s authenticated transport instruction','Ia ditahan di K-3 berdasarkan instruksi transportasi terautentikasi Ivo',[('He independently vanished with no traceable route','Ia hilang mandiri tanpa rute dapat ditelusuri'),('The report proves he was killed','Laporan membuktikan ia dibunuh'),('A voluntary consultation is established by its label alone','Konsultasi sukarela dipastikan labelnya saja')]),
('How was information used?','Bagaimana informasi dipakai?','Specific private disclosures preceded tailored pressure on withdrawing workers','Pengungkapan privat spesifik mendahului tekanan disesuaikan pada pekerja mundur',[('A universal personality formula compelled all behavior','Rumus kepribadian universal memaksa semua perilaku'),('Only publicly supplied application facts were quoted','Hanya fakta permohonan publik dikutip'),('All monitoring stayed inside contract scope','Semua pemantauan tetap dalam lingkup kontrak')]),
